            <ArticleTitle>A tellurylsulfide bond-containing redox-responsive superparamagnetic nanogel with acid-responsiveness for efficient anticancer therapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13141-13144</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc07615k</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A tellurylsulfide bond-containing biopolymer nanogel was first fabricated to achieve smart drug release. The reductive nanogel exhibited highly sensitive reduction-responsiveness, fast internalization, and efficient anticancer therapy. This approach displays a new potential of tellurylsulfide bond-containing nanocarriers for drug delivery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
